# I04.var05 v1.0.2 supplemental receipt reader — GO_SUPPLEMENTAL_REPLAY_ONLY

Decision: **GO_SUPPLEMENTAL_REPLAY_ONLY** for one read-only recovered-copy run of the exact supplemental reader. This does not replace the frozen first replay's `NO_GO_POSTRUN_AS_FROZEN`, authorize SIMLOX again, or accept the native result before the supplemental replay passes every gate.

The prospective recovery contract is 5,329/SHA-256 `65cb30fe750037ce049f982b126c59e1a72dd387753f78003dace4021029d5ce`. Original `review/independent_replay.py` remains 88,398/SHA-256 `1011bb6e21719cf767cc416610ffb11d02c1f819e56a0ae03d0a081fed5b14b2`. The future-allowed `review/independent-postrun-receipt-reader-v1.py` is 88,559/SHA-256 `7c8a30b3ca51b9db17614ba24617f84b1000845a86d6c73485bbf6402ca917b0`, read-only. Byte-diff witness `tmp/i04-var05-v102-supplemental-reader-byte-diff-20261008.json` is 2,095/SHA-256 `1c27f0f0c149a2880cd05e98ed751b08535b8273316b8cbb9cef953c05fd0d6f`: adding the sole `native_run_directory` exact key and a strict `str`/exact `str(RUN)` assertion are the only two source changes. Reverse byte replacements recover the original exactly. The original reader has 1,635 LF and zero CRLF byte sequences; an earlier root planning description of CRLF was mistaken. The builder preserved the actual LF bytes and did not normalize the source.

Separate scratch-clone probes used no sealed evidence edit and no author checker. Frozen `tmp/i04-var05-v102-supplemental-receipt-negatives-20261008.py` is 4,792/SHA-256 `8a8337f5fd968501fcb3c02b6fb51450327fd3912da5820d744e972b48214b5c`. Root's original binary capture `tmp/i04-var05-root-review-proofs-v102-20261008/supplemental-negatives-20261008T104127750871Z-bd09d9a6/receipt.json` is 1,371/SHA-256 `2c3e29153f12db089d778dca73e12eba62b506686749dbc95147e2146bb5b741`, actual integer exit 0, empty original stderr, unchanged method pins. Original stdout is 498/SHA-256 `4719613428deb73d5eebfb141522071f13feba93a09686eba0db159abf515174`: baseline cloned receipt passes; missing field, wrong path, boolean, numeric non-string and unknown extra field each reject; original sealed author receipt SHA-256 `1f2a25c61fd572dc60bd2c09ea8b29f88cb048214643ccfb96b281034c6dd412` remains unchanged.

Root's unexecuted supplemental capture method is 5,374/SHA-256 `d34736d7a3b5412b992c049e765ac2662fc38445c366ce5b4c75af7960db4d2a`, read-only. It keeps the original approval and invocation bound to the frozen reader's SHA, rehashes all 4,203 manifest roles and 25 original closure files, performs a fresh SSH GUI/mutex/no-runner guard, makes exact read-only recovered copies, and runs the supplemental reader once with the exact new SHA as an argument. It captures original stdout/stderr and actual integer exit without a native call. Any failure remains NO_GO and is preserved. A later positive supplemental original proof still requires an independent direct byte audit and separate bounded postrun decision before publication work.
